## 7. Documentation Approach

Each SQL script is organized by analytical phase and includes:

- Query title and objective.
- Business question.
- SQL implementation.
- Explanation of important SQL concepts.
- Output description.
- Business relevance.

All analytical findings and recommendations will be based on actual query results.
